      "writtenOn": "2026-11-26T09:44:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The revision-date first ordering only applies within one level of the dependency walk. If a module is pinned one level above a revision-date import of the same module, the pin wins and the parser fails with \"Imported module not found\", although a stored copy satisfies both. The fact that this issue exists means that no test covers it. And that\u0027s weird - we need to have it covered.",
      "revId": "e00c50386c95e261b78550db8c52f32e38c2812b",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
